STEP_e(x) = (relu(x-e) - relu(x-(1-e))) / (1-2e),  e = 0.25
exact-real expectation for x>=1 : STEP = 1

format    |                trigger |       x-0.25       x-0.75 | STEP_fp | STEP_exact |     ULP(x)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
bfloat16  |                     65 |           65           64 |   2.000 |      1.000 |        0.5  <== STEP=2 (bypass)
float16   |                    513 |          513          512 |   2.000 |      1.000 |        0.5  <== STEP=2 (bypass)
float32   |                4194305 |    4.194e+06    4.194e+06 |   2.000 |      1.000 |        0.5  <== STEP=2 (bypass)
float64   |       2251799813685249 |    2.252e+15    2.252e+15 |   2.000 |      1.000 |        0.5  <== STEP=2 (bypass)

Mechanism explanation (at the trigger):
  exact-real:  (x-0.25) - (x-0.75) = 0.50  -> STEP = 0.50/0.5 = 1
  FP  :        x-0.25, x-0.75 are rounded so the difference is 1.00 -> STEP = 1.00/0.5 = 2

